---
// Signature detail — exactly one for this surface.
//
// The product IS an address, so the address is the artifact worth showing. Set
// in mono as an editorial figure, not a card floating in dead air, and not a
// div-built imitation of a product UI.
//
// The suite number is masked and the name is generic on purpose: a plausible
// full address would eventually get something shipped to it.
// TODO: confirm the real warehouse city with operations before launch.
---

<div class="hero-enter hero-delay-4">
  <p class="max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-200/85">
    Al registrarte recibes una dirección propia en Miami. Compras con ella en cualquier tienda, como
    si vivieras allá.
  </p>

  <address class="mt-6 font-mono text-sm not-italic leading-relaxed text-white/90">
    <span class="block text-xs tracking-[0.14em] text-white/45">EJEMPLO</span>
    <span class="mt-2 block">Tu nombre · <span class="text-accent-400">RE-2481</span></span>
    <span class="block text-white/60">Suite ••••, Miami, FL</span>
    <span class="block text-white/60">Estados Unidos</span>
  </address>
</div>
